    "name": "My Demo Corp — HR System PoC (OData v4 & REST API)",
    "description": "Complete Postman collection for testing the My Demo Corp HR System PoC (v1.1).\n\n### Configuration Parameters (Collection Variables)\n- `baseUrl`: Base URL of the HR PoC application without trailing slash (default: `http://localhost/hr` when deployed to IIS, or `http://localhost:5080` for local `dotnet run`).\n- `employeeId`, `departmentId`, `costCenterId`, `locationId`: Sample IDs for single-record `GET(key)` requests.\n- `createdEmployeeId`, `createdDepartmentId`, `createdCostCenterId`, `createdLocationId`: Automatically populated when you execute the `POST` requests so you can immediately run `PATCH`, `PUT`, and `DELETE` in sequence.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost/hr",
      "type": "string"
    },
