            "description": "Creates a new Employee via OData v4. Note that you can pass either `DepartmentId`/`CostCenterId`/`LocationId` OR `DepartmentStructuredName`/`CostCenterStructuredName`/`LocationStructuredName` — the server automatically resolves and synchronizes the paired fields."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Partial Update Employee — Transfer / Terminate (PATCH)",
